# Service Control Transport SPEC

## Background

Hydra service control is the authority of service registry semantics.
RedQueen provides concrete RPC access implementations for Hydra service control.

Service lifecycle, metadata, discovery and later service abilities must share one
client topology. RPC differences are expressed by ServiceClientTransport only.
Feature abilities are expressed by ServicePort, not by extra transport types.

## Core Rules

1. Hydra owns service registry abstraction, lifecycle state and metadata contracts.
2. RedQueen owns RPC concrete implementations, such as Husky and gRPC.
3. One RPC kind has one ServiceClientTransport implementation.
4. ServiceClientTransport manages connection, session and native RPC resources.
5. ServicePort exposes service-control abilities on top of the transport.
6. Upper business code should use ServiceClient or ServicePort, not native RPC APIs.

## Hydra Abstract Topology
```
com.pinecone.hydra.service.registry.client
  ServiceClient.java
  UniformServiceClient.java

com.pinecone.hydra.service.registry.client.port
  ServicePort.java
  ServiceLifecyclePort.java
  ServiceMetaPort.java

com.pinecone.hydra.service.registry.client.transport
  ServiceClientTransport.java
  ServiceClientTransportType.java
  ServiceClientTransportException.java
```

## RedQueen RPC Topology

```
com.acorn.redqueen.service.registry.{rpc}
  client
    {Rpc}ServiceClientTransport.java
    {Rpc}ServiceClientTransportFactory.java
    {Rpc}ServiceClientTransportConfig.java

    port
      {Rpc}ServiceLifecyclePort.java
      {Rpc}ServiceMetaPort.java

    mapper
      {Rpc}ServiceLifecycleMapper.java
      {Rpc}ServiceMetaMapper.java

  server
    {Rpc}ServiceControlTransport.java
    {Rpc}ServiceControlTransportFactory.java

    lifecycle
      {Rpc}ServiceLifecycleController.java
      {Rpc}ServiceLifecycleService.java
      {Rpc}ServiceLifecycleMapper.java
      {Rpc}ServiceClientile.java

    meta
      {Rpc}ServiceMetaController.java
      {Rpc}ServiceMetaService.java
      {Rpc}ServiceMetaMapper.java

  protocol
    ...
```

## Husky Package
```
com.acorn.redqueen.service.registry.husky
  client
  client.port
  client.mapper
  server
  server.lifecycle
  server.meta
  protocol
```
## gRPC Package
```
com.acorn.redqueen.service.registry.grpc
  client
  client.port
  client.mapper
  server
  server.lifecycle
  server.meta
  protocol.lifecycle.proto
  protocol.meta.proto
```
## Naming Notes

Lifecycle means service registration control.
Meta means service directory, service metadata and instance metadata.
Query is not a top-level package name for service control transport.
Legacy package names are not allowed.
